From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:55:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] phy: qcom: qmp-combo: Use the mode switch sequence on an
 orientation change

qmp_combo_typec_switch_set() reprograms an initialised PHY for a new
cable orientation with its own copy of the power-down and power-up
sequence. That copy differs from qmp_combo_reconfigure_phy(), which the
mode switch uses:

- it powers the USB PHY on again in DP-only mode, writing the USB3 lane
  tables over both lane blocks that DP owns in that mode;
- it does not put the DP PHY into power-down before the common block is
  reset, and runs dp_aux_init() in USB3-only mode as well;
- it ignores errors from the common initialisation and the USB
  power-on, so a failure leaves the PHY half configured and is not
  reported.

Use qmp_combo_reconfigure_phy() with the current mode instead, so an
orientation change goes through the same sequence as a mode change and
returns its errors to the Type-C switch.

Assisted-by: Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c | 14 ++------------
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
index 6f56891932c..168e539a30b 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
@@ -5276,7 +5276,6 @@ static int qmp_combo_typec_switch_set(struct typec_switch_dev *sw,
 				      enum typec_orientation orientation)
 {
 	struct qmp_combo *qmp = typec_switch_get_drvdata(sw);
-	const struct qmp_phy_cfg *cfg = qmp->cfg;
 
 	if (qmp->qmpphy_mode == QMPPHY_MODE_USB4) {
 		/* QMPPHY has no orientation handling in USB4 mode, don't cache the setting */
@@ -5290,17 +5289,8 @@ static int qmp_combo_typec_switch_set(struct typec_switch_dev *sw,
 	guard(mutex)(&qmp->phy_mutex);
 	qmp->orientation = orientation;
 
-	if (qmp->init_count) {
-		if (qmp->usb_init_count || qmp->usb4_init_count)
-			qmp_combo_usb_power_off(qmp->usb_phy);
-		qmp_combo_com_exit(qmp, true);
-
-		qmp_combo_com_init(qmp, true);
-		if (qmp->usb_init_count || qmp->usb4_init_count)
-			qmp_combo_usb_power_on(qmp->usb_phy);
-		if (qmp->dp_init_count)
-			cfg->dp_aux_init(qmp);
-	}
+	if (qmp->init_count)
+		return qmp_combo_reconfigure_phy(qmp, qmp->qmpphy_mode);
 
 	return 0;
 }
